","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3086,"like_count":181,"quote_count":16,"reply_count":87,"retweet_count":83},"text":"Trump THANKS PUTIN for striking a deal to pump massive amounts of diesel into the U.S. \"You heard about the oil deal with Russia. That is a big deal. I want to THANK President Putin, to be honest with you!\"\n\nTrump is a Putin-loving Russian asset; wonder what his kickback will be? https://t.co/36LCr8LDcp"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108656297419718656"]},"author_id":"856590732907433985","created_at":"2026-10-09T20:30:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108656302092394931"],"id":"2108656302092394931","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":3102,"like_count":173,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":39},"text":"Great to see ex-Chancellor of Germany Gerhard Schröder meeting Putin on his birthday. Enough of all the bickering &amp; warmongering. European nations should all be friends &amp; respectful of each other's concerns. NATO should be abolished or retreat to the agreed 1990 borders. ☮️ https://t.co/D33OVxcJjF"},{"author_id":"1561842129415966721","created_at":"2026-10-10T00:20:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108714147177529530"],"id":"2108714147177529530","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":6980,"like_count":446,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":51},"text":"3 weeks ago: we are going to put a 100% tariff on any country buying Russian oil\n\nToday: please, President Putin, Sir, sell us some diesel fuel\n\nThe jokes write themselves"},{"author_id":"454099919","created_at":"2026-10-09T21:35:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108672628026397154"],"id":"2108672628026397154","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":19957,"like_count":2591,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":174,"retweet_count":470},"text":"Over 80% of Americans think that Putin is a bad guy.\n\nTrump just handed Putin a giant gift.\n\nTrump is dangerously out of step with American society on this issue. \n\nLet's see if it matters in the upcoming elections."},{"author_id":"1449140157903482882","created_at":"2026-10-09T19:39:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108643472466907566"],"id":"2108643472466907566","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":206,"impression_count":185931,"like_count":5358,"quote_count":125,"reply_count":231,"retweet_count":622},"text":"JUST IN: 🇺🇦🇺🇸 Ukraine says it is surprised by President Trump's deal with President Putin to lift sanctions and buy Russian diesel."},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108598621725671424"]},"author_id":"2530835306","created_at":"2026-10-09T16:42:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108599114569306292"],"id":"2108599114569306292","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":8210,"like_count":481,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":191},"text":"When the ICC issues an arrest warrant for Putin the world cheered.\n\nWhen the ICC issues an arrest warrant for Netanyahu it becomes a \"Rogue Court\"\n\nThis administration ONLY SERVES Netanyahu and his interests at the expense of EVERYONE worldwide.  He is in charge. https://t.co/CkphBVslaa"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108648932012089345"]},"author_id":"1355721251180961792","created_at":"2026-10-09T20:00:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108648936458408156"],"id":"2108648936458408156","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":37,"impression_count":39367,"like_count":1514,"quote_count":32,"reply_count":480,"retweet_count":382},"text":"🚨 BREAKING: President Trump just got off the phone with Putin, and diesel is about to get cheaper.\n\nRussia agreed to dump fuel on the American and global market…\n\n300,000 tons immediately. 500,000 tons in November. 1,000,000 tons right after that. Then another 3,000,000 tons https://t.co/imT6RYmBcx"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108642850560700416"]},"author_id":"1313536464022646786","created_at":"2026-10-09T19:36:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108642854176534989"],"id":"2108642854176534989","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":896,"impression_count":432075,"like_count":13784,"quote_count":161,"reply_count":701,"retweet_count":2748},"text":"That’s a bombshell 👀\n\nTrump just made a deal with Putin for Russia to supply us with diesel fuel. Not only is that massive for gas prices and the midterms, it’s a great sign for potential deal to end the war in Ukraine, and it confirms that Trump and Putin are on the same page. https://t.co/OLkKn1p09d"},{"author_id":"1447734156843225095","created_at":"2026-10-09T20:04:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108649878108672400"],"id":"2108649878108672400","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":7342,"like_count":70,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":17},"text":"The Kremlin: Putin and Trump agreed to continue personal communications and cooperation between the institutions and intelligence agencies of the two countries\n\n🇺🇸🇷🇺‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️‼️"},{"author_id":"1243560408025198593","created_at":"2026-10-09T20:19:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108653702127210562"],"id":"2108653702127210562","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":84,"impression_count":57129,"like_count":3006,"quote_count":60,"reply_count":182,"retweet_count":1186},"text":"Trump’s deal to buy Russian diesel from Putin just weeks before the midterms funnels money directly into Russia’s war machine. Trump is now facing calls for Congress to block the deal and impeach him. Meanwhile, energy analysts say it’s unlikely to even make a dent in fuel"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108700230153551872"]},"author_id":"624486029","created_at":"2026-10-09T23:24:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108700239813398540"],"id":"2108700239813398540","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":6930,"like_count":661,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":172},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108647347487949253","type":"quoted"}],"text":"In 2020, Presidents Putin and Trump jointly stabilized oil prices and markets. Today, they continue their work. \n\nThe diesel supply agreement showcases the power of economic cooperation between Russia and the US and its benefits to people and the world. Cooperation will prevail. https://t.co/LWq9q0nBOp https://t.co/nEIcIcQTO1"},{"author_id":"50944856","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:16:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108728223760884015"],"id":"2108728223760884015","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2961,"like_count":83,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":26},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108639752031252499","type":"quoted"}],"text":"So what happened to the 'putting pressure on President Putin' over the Ukraine issue? Europe meekly watches as this announcement is made? As does state department? \nhttps://t.co/8qkMcAxjkY"},{"author_id":"454099919","created_at":"2026-10-09T19:38:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108643349599281652"],"id":"2108643349599281652","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":76,"impression_count":45857,"like_count":3890,"quote_count":91,"reply_count":372,"retweet_count":1341},"text":"Trump not only cut off US military assistance to Ukraine, but he is now providing Putin with new money to build more Russian rockets and drones to kill Ukrainians. Absolutely deplorable. \n\nTrump says US to get diesel from Russia, relaxing pressure on Moscow to ease prices before"},{"author_id":"256154569","created_at":"2026-10-09T22:39:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108688940609966427"],"id":"2108688940609966427","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":6849,"like_count":640,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":200},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108671382972231983","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Susie standing back there listening to this maniac thank Putin while her daughter travels to Sprska to meet with Dodik. \n\nWhat a bunch of sickening, grifting traitors. https://t.co/lOg2tGNYzk"},{"author_id":"1298372735383605249","created_at":"2026-10-09T19:00:14.000Z","edit_hist